WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.550
Watch the silver eye on top of the are

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:14.559
just watch

00:00:14.559 --> 00:00:16.559
Every time it swings

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:19.529
Let's pretend we're unraveling a piece of string

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.260
little by little

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.649
Let's pretend that piece of string is time

00:00:27.189 --> 00:00:29.189
Unraveling minute by minute

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.980
Second by second

00:00:32.559 --> 00:00:34.559
going backwards

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.340
time

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.340
slipping away

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:42.129
Everything around you

00:00:42.129 --> 00:00:44.129
this house

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:45.969
my voice

00:00:45.969 --> 00:00:47.590
your mother

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:49.590
all these things

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:51.780
Are getting further away

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.530
We're going back through your life

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:58.979
Back to when you started school when?

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:02.490
You first learned to walk

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:06.270
When you were just a baby

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:12.029
Back to the day you were born

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:18.270
Back to the time before this model

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:26.820
I'm no longer speaking to miles

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:31.529
I'm speaking to the person who has taken residence inside his body

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:34.260
He came uninvited

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:38.220
Tell me if you can hear my voice

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:06.320
Miles

00:02:08.259 --> 00:02:10.259
Miles what's wrong?

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.760
Mommy I'm scared

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:19.260
Come here, baby

